message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "pypsa-gb-abm: an agent-based model of GB electricity investment and operation"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based model (Python package ukabm, built on Mesa and PyPSA) of investment and hourly
  operation in the Great Britain electricity market, 2025-2050, with a government, a system operator,
  generation companies and households as agents, compared with a least-cost capacity expansion plan
  on the same inputs.
type: software
